        "denialFound": "None found, and no one was asked. This is a descriptive count of DRDO's own published addresses and alleges no wrongdoing, so no response is needed.",
        "innocentReading": "Labs are placed next to their users and suppliers. Aeronautics and radar sit with HAL, ADA and BEL in Bengaluru. Missiles sit with BDL and the Kanchanbagh complex in Hyderabad. Delhi's labs (Metcalfe House, Timarpur) hold the headquarters-adjacent functions: analysis, cryptology, physiology and psychology. Most of this siting was set in the 1950s–80s. The claim's own innocent reading is adequate.",
        "reason": "The source pages do not support the numbers. Counting the cluster pages, and the file's own 42 footprint rows built from them, gives Bengaluru 8, Delhi 7, Hyderabad 7, which is 22 of 42, with Pune at 4. The claim's 9/8/8 (25) and Pune 5 come from also counting the DG cluster-headquarters offices in the numerator while keeping a denominator of 42 that excludes them. The claim's own totals also exceed 42 (25+5+8 = 38, leaving 4 rows for 8 single-lab cities). Separately, the killIf as written is already met: the claim itself says DIAT, DFRL, DIHAR and DRL are missing from the pages, so it states its own kill condition. That is a framing defect, not a fact against the pattern, because the missing labs are mostly outside the top three cities. Analytic is the right tier for a corrected count; the figures as written are wrong.",
        "corrections": [
          "1) Change the text and lab field to: \"22 of the 42 labs/centres addressed on DRDO's seven technology-cluster pages sit in Bengaluru (8), Delhi (7) and Hyderabad (7)\". 2) Change the d field to: \"Pune 4; Chennai, Dehradun, Chandigarh, Balasore 2 each; Agra, Ahilyanagar, Kanpur, Jodhpur, Ambernath, Kochi, Visakhapatnam, Gwalior 1 each (sum 42). DG cluster-HQ offices (Bengaluru ECS, Hyderabad MSS, Pune ACE, Visakhapatnam NS&M, New Delhi SSS/MCC) and DIT&CS are excluded; DYSL-AI has no printed address.\" 3) Turn the killIf into a scope note plus a real falsifier. Scope note: \"Excludes HR-cluster centres (DESIDOC, CEPTAM, RAC Delhi; ITM Mussoorie) and labs on no cluster page (DIAT Pune, DFRL Mysuru, DIHAR Leh, DRL Tezpur, DIBER Haldwani; ADA Bengaluru is a separate society).\" Falsifier: \"a complete DRDO establishment list puts the three-city share below 45%\". 4) Add the corporate-clusters HR page as a source if those centres are mentioned. 5) Keep tier analytic, pred analytic, s/t force:drdo."
        ],
