          "text/lab: replace \"SC stay 2018\" / \"SC stays (2018)\" with \"SC (2016-07-22) directed the Centre to take possession and not demolish pending appeal; Army took possession July 2016\". d: replace \"the SC stayed demolition in 2018 and the Army took custody\" with the same 2016 wording. Name Ashok Chavan as the former CM. Add \"report partially accepted by the state cabinet after Dec 2013 rejection\". Add a contra/response: Chavan calls it a \"political accident\" (ThePrint 2024-04-20), the HC quashed for want of fresh evidence, and the society's SC appeal is pending. Add a symmetryCheck: sanction refused 2013 (UPA-era governor), granted 2016 (NDA-era governor), Chavan joined BJP Feb 2024. srcs: change the Wikipedia URL to https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adarsh_Housing_Society_scandal and add https://www.deccanchronicle.com/nation/current-affairs/220716/sc-quashes-hc-order-asks-centre-to-halt-demolition-of-adarsh-building.html and https://theprint.in/india/demolition-regularisation-pleas-pending-chavan-moves-on-but-mumbais-adarsh-society-languishes/2048404/. \"No verdict as of 2024\": keep, attributed to ThePrint 2024-04-20 (demolition petitions still pending)."
