        "denialFound": "The Union's response appears in the same judgment, from its affidavit: \"The Petitioner's interpretation is an attempt to equalize the pension of every defense personnel with the highest pension drawn by a defense personnel in the same rank with the same length of service. Such an interpretation is completely arbitrary definition...\" It also said annual revision \"would cause administrative difficulty and is impracticable\" and that \"The phrase 'automatically' does not mean the time period.\" The Court found no constitutional infirmity in the 7 Nov 2015 policy. It directed the five-yearly re-fixation from 1 Jul 2019 and disposed of the petition (https://indiankanoon.org/doc/160389977/).",
